# ─── personal data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The real show history stays out of this public repo. source.csv and
# overrides.json are symlinks into the private band-cloud-data repo, and
# data.json is built from them and carries exactly the same facts, so ignoring
# one without the other would be pointless.
#
# `data/sample.csv` and `data/sample.overrides.json` are committed in their
# place — the build falls back to them automatically, so a fresh clone runs.
data/source.csv
data/overrides.json
assets/data.json

# Generated from the real data every build: open questions about the private
# history, so it doesn't belong here either.
REVIEW.md

